          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतियोगिता — pratiyogitā — \"a competition\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर कल प्रतियोगिता होगी तो पूरा स्कूल आएगा। agar kal pratiyogitā hogī to pūrā skūl āegā. If the competition is tomorrow, the whole school will come."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतियोगिता (pratiyogitā) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit pratiyogitā, \"correlation\" (Monier-Williams). Monier-Williams does not give the sense of a contest, which is usually taken as a modern Hindi one."
            }
          ]
        },
